      "description": "Unboxed PR state and separate CI label from site/style.css. Illustrative labels show vocabulary, not a live observation.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-signals\"><div><span class=\"ds-signal-heading\">PR state</span><span class=\"ds-state\">Open</span></div><div><span class=\"ds-signal-heading\">CI evidence</span><span class=\"ds-ci\">Unknown</span></div></div>",
