      "description": "Tonal status container from site/index.html and site/style.css, using the real loading copy rather than a fabricated timestamp.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-freshness\" aria-label=\"Data freshness\"><div><p class=\"ds-freshness-text\" role=\"status\">Loading verified snapshot...</p><p class=\"ds-freshness-help\">Automatically refreshed about every 15 minutes; schedules can be delayed.</p></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-freshness{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;background:var(--soft,#edf3ee);color:var(--ink,#22332b);border:1px solid var(--line,#dce3dd);border-radius:7px;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;font-size:.81rem;line-height:1.5}.ds-freshness-text{margin:0}.ds-freshness-help{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted,#5d6a62);margin:3px 0 0}@media(max-width:650px){.ds-freshness{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:14px}.ds-freshness-help{line-height:1.6}}"
